-- Owner comparison with UWOW (VotW, 2026-09-28, Claude): keystones and Mythic 0 still had too much health after the
-- HpMulti revert, because 2026-09-26 fix_hp_launch_dungeons.sql also multiplied creature_difficulty_stat (which replaces
-- HpMulti in Heroic/Mythic/Keystone) by 2.068 for the same 354 entries.
-- 1. exact revert of that x2.068 on creature_difficulty_stat
-- 2. UWOW uses the same multiplier for Mythic 0 and keystones (M0 = keystone base); 94 launch entries had Mythic =
--    keystone / 1.35 (e.g. Shadow Hunter 98926). Mythic := keystone for those. Result for 98926: M0 14.82M (UWOW 14.82M),
--    +25 175.0M (UWOW 175M). Undo: undo_hp_launch_dungeons_diffstat.sql (row dump from before)
